gb18030 and GBK	2005	note	the year of the GB18030-2005 revision, in a note on the ranges index
Big5	0x20000	code	the forward table holds 16 bits and a bit array says "plus 0x20000" for the 1,713 code points of plane 2 (gtext_encoding_big5_plane2)
